:NOTE
English is not an official language of the Swiss Confederation. This translation is provided for information purposes only and has no legal force.

:INFO
Art. 23
1 Securities firms that do not hold accounts in accordance with Article 44 paragraph 1 letter a FinIA must provide FINMA with evidence on a quarterly basis that they have adequate capital.
2 The capital statement on a consolidated basis must be provided every six months.
3 The evidence must be submitted within six weeks of the end of the quarter or half-year.

